HydraBBS V1 Install
===================

WHEN YOU'VE INSTALLED HYDRABBS READ THE FILE CALLED "README.1ST"
IN THE HBBS DIRECTORY FOR *VERY* IMPORTANT INFORMATION!

Double click the "Installer_Script" icon to install it

Read all on-screen prompts as you run through the installers
so that you don't miss anything.

Thanks for taking the time to download and use this software, it means
alot to me, so drop me an e-mail!